'''Scars of War''' (戦争のつめあと ''Sensō no Tsume Ato,'' '''Scars of War''') is the 25th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien enemies]] are prominent in this sub-chapter, which means the difficulty will vary depending on your [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]]. It will be extremely hard if you have none of them, average if you have all from Chapter 1, very easy if you have all from Chapters 1 and 2, and a pushover if you have all from Chapters 1, 2 and 3. The hardest stage overall is [[Father's Back]], which plays like a tougher version of [[Imp's cold sweat]] or [[Broken Mask]].
{{LegendDiff|120|140|110}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter features no brand new mechanics, but it is the first Stories of Legend sub-chapter to feature [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]]. Most Aliens from Into the Future Chapter 1 are present.

